<title>HONG KONG: Tack Hsin posts HK$3.6 mln interim loss.</title>
<headline>Tack Hsin posts HK$3.6 mln interim loss.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   1.21 loss vs  2.42 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    2.0	 vs  1.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	 vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    3.64 loss vs  7.26 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     229.42    vs  235.00</p>
<p>    Company name		 Tack Hsin Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 6-9</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   January 20</p>
<p>NOTE - Tack Hsin operates a chain of &quot;hot pot&quot; restaurants.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
